te and press down.\n5. Take a mold and break the dalgona with a hammer in the shape of a dalgona.", "short_description": "Understand and learn about the interesting scientific phenomena behind the cooking process of making dalgona in virtual reality."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9512823328773790"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974891_952378780074572_3506988048425322897_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NQGeuMwxT2AQ7kNvwHmFRgv&_nc_oc=AdpZWuT2CNm8Qku1IRcU_qNUjaNcqMt0QBY78B--GzjtupUdHsYGCO44Sl87kaOcVFs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7VUveEQ46Oj7Li3lML4CBr59-_y-GGcIVuZy4I9dZAXg&oe=69FDEE6A"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Science in Cooking: Dalgona", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Hands-On Training", "id": "